// SendOffString :
"P3999317302" "You must find these shadow crystals and destroy them, {HeroName}.  I know not what foul manner of magic they contain, but I do know that they are the source of the Dark Ones' incredible power.<br><br><color orange>You have 60 minutes to complete this task.</color>"
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3489557563" "Destroy the shadow crystals"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P587700419" "Time is not on our side, {HeroName}.  Not only do the Dark Ones use these crystals for power, but I believe that they have magical ability to move his men from one place to another!"

